From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: office <office@localhost>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +0500
Subject: [PATCH] translit: Uzbek Latin/Cyrillic commands for slide text and notes (new engine module, uz-translit dependency)

The command registry is a closed OnceLock (command_specs()), so the three transliteration commands (tools.translitCyrl,
tools.translitLatn, tools.translitAuto) are a new engine module, crates/engine/src/cmd/translit.rs. It converts the text runs of
shapes, groups, table cells and speaker notes through the uz-translit rules (an in-monorepo path dependency): the selected
text range, the selected shapes, the slide or the whole deck. Run properties, link targets and language tags are untouched;
field, break and equation runs are boundaries. One command is one undo step (Session::edit). Tests: crates/engine/tests/translit.rs.
